---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { ui } from '../../i18n/ui';

const lang = 'en';
const t = ui[lang];
---

<Base lang={lang} title="Privacy Policy | WordPicker" description="WordPicker Privacy Policy: how the extension and this site handle your information.">
  <Header lang={lang} />
  <main class="py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">{t.footer.legal.privacy}</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: August 7, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">1. Overview</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            WordPicker is a hover-to-look-up browser extension; this site introduces the product. We respect and protect user privacy. This policy explains how the extension and the site handle your information.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">2. Extension Data</h2>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>Looked-up words and your wordbook are stored in your browser's local storage by default and are not uploaded to our servers.</li>
            <li>If cloud wordbook sync is enabled, the data is used solely to sync between your devices.</li>
            <li>The extension does not collect browsing history, page content, or any data unrelated to word lookup.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">3. This Website</h2>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>The site is static, offers no account registration, and does not actively collect personally identifiable information.</li>
            <li>The hosting platform (Cloudflare Pages) may record basic access logs under its own policies, outside our control.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">4. Cookies & Local Storage</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            The site may use cookies or localStorage to remember interface preferences such as language, solely to improve browsing and never for cross-site tracking.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">5. Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            The site links to browser extension stores and GitHub; their privacy practices are governed by their own policies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">6. Changes & Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            This policy may be updated as the product evolves; changes will be posted here. Questions can be raised via Issues on our
            <a href="https://github.com/bayernjf/word-picker" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300">GitHub repository</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer lang={lang} />
</Base>
